reciprocalness:
中：n. reciprocal的变形
英：n. The quality or condition of being reciprocal;
   mutual return; alternateness.

redeemableness:
中：n. redeemable的变形
英：n. The quality or state of being redeemable;
   redeemability.

relishable:
中：a. relish的变形
英：a. Capable of being relished; agreeable to the taste;
   gratifying.

remissory:
中：a. remission的变形
英：a. Serving or tending to remit, or to secure remission;
   remissive.

remitment:
中：n. remit的变形
英：n. The act of remitting, or the state of being remitted;
   remission.

renitency:
中：n. 抵抗, 顽强性, 顽强, 抵抗性
英：n. The state or quality of being renitent; resistance;
   reluctance.

repugnancy:
音标：/ri'pʌ^nәnsi/
中：n. 反对, 矛盾
英：n. The state or condition of being repugnant; opposition;
   contrariety; especially, a strong instinctive antagonism; aversion;
   reluctance; unwillingness, as of mind, passions, principles, qualities,
   and the like.

respondency:
中：n. 作答, 反应, 响应, 符合, 一致
英：n. The act of responding; the state of being respondent;
   an answering.

revealability:
中：n. reveal的变形
英：n. The quality or state of being revealable;
   revealableness.

rhynchophora:
中：象虫组
英：n. pl. A group of Coleoptera having a snoutlike head;
   the snout beetles, curculios, or weevils.

ridiculosity:
中：n. ridiculous的变形
英：n. The quality or state of being ridiculous;
   ridiculousness; also, something ridiculous.

romanticness:
中：n. romantic的变形
英：n. The state or quality of being romantic; widness;
   fancifulness.
